WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:06.043
Import a manuscript

2
00:00:06.551 --> 00:00:12.398
Already wrote it somewhere else? Choose Import Word or Markdown.

3
00:00:12.401 --> 00:00:19.709
Word, Markdown (say, from ChatGPT), EPUB, RTF and plain text all work.

4
00:00:19.712 --> 00:00:24.664
Pick your file. The title fills in from its name, and you can change it.

5
00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:35.575
Each top heading becomes its own chapter. Bold, italic, lists, footnotes and images come across.

6
00:00:35.579 --> 00:00:38.880
Here it is, split into chapters and ready to edit.
